    "markov": "Arithmetic supplied the proof; root and braid independently checked all three written files. Checked Grothendieck localization against the original measure, arbitrary positive atom weights, coarea, strict mass bounds, minimum-mass peeling, earliest-endpoint charging, defective Cheeger exterior energy, negative eigenvalues, exact block-mean cancellation, zero defect, and the commutative-range UCP corollary. Braid checked the primary Grothendieck constant.",
