    "staircase": "Braid supplied the proof; root and charge independently checked the written construction. Checked projective two-transitivity, augmentation characters, CRT product surjectivity, tail irreducibility and inequivalence, canonical character convergence through the common last factor, exact expectation norms, lazy Kazhdan gap, 13^k Kraus count, distortion on every macroscopic central corner, and height constants. Charge verified Kassabov Theorem A for the stated generators.",
    "quantum_variance": "Charge and root independently derived the estimates; arithmetic audited the final transcription. Checked reflected-corner complete positivity, unitality and stationarity, the nonnegative energy subtraction, projection deficit transfer, spectral coarea and median constants, ambient versus corner trace normalization, and the M4 example over every eligible rank-one quantum projection."
