  "remaining_quantum_step": "The classical partition proof does not yet extend to an orthogonal physical decomposition. Noncommuting projection meets can lose mass. Compressing a repaired positive function imports a fixed cut-energy term, and repeated source leakage cannot be charged only to previous boundaries. An aggregate orthogonal cut estimate using the localized relative defect or a compatible selection rule remains unproved. The reflected-corner theorem proves the variance step, not this decomposition.",
